<title>ISRAEL: Netanyahu wants Israel-PLO recommitment to Oslo.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu wants Israel-PLO recommitment to Oslo.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said after meeting U.S. Secretary of State Warren Christopher on Sunday that Israel sought a joint recommitment with the Palestinians to their peace accords.</p>
<p>&quot;What we seek is a simultaneous recommitment by both sides to the principles that both signed on to in Oslo,&quot; he said in a reference to their peace deals launched in 1993 in the Norwegian capital.</p>
</text>
